<h2 id="풀이">풀이(</h2>
<div class="language-python highlighter-rouge"><div class="highlight"><pre class="highlight"><code><span class="k">def</span> <span class="nf">solution</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">n</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="n">lost</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="n">reserve</span><span class="p">):</span>
    <span class="n">set_r</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="nf">set</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">reserve</span><span class="p">)</span><span class="o">-</span><span class="nf">set</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">lost</span><span class="p">)</span>
    <span class="n">set_l</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="nf">set</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">lost</span><span class="p">)</span><span class="o">-</span><span class="nf">set</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">reserve</span><span class="p">)</span>
    
    <span class="k">for</span> <span class="n">i</span> <span class="ow">in</span> <span class="n">set_r</span><span class="p">:</span>
        <span class="k">if</span> <span class="n">i</span><span class="o">-</span><span class="mi">1</span> <span class="ow">in</span> <span class="n">set_l</span><span class="p">:</span>
            <span class="n">set_l</span><span class="p">.</span><span class="nf">remove</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">i</span><span class="o">-</span><span class="mi">1</span><span class="p">)</span>
        <span class="k">elif</span> <span class="n">i</span><span class="o">+</span><span class="mi">1</span> <span class="ow">in</span> <span class="n">set_l</span><span class="p">:</span>
            <span class="n">set_l</span><span class="p">.</span><span class="nf">remove</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">i</span><span class="o">+</span><span class="mi">1</span><span class="p">)</span>
    <span class="k">return</span> <span class="n">n</span><span class="o">-</span><span class="nf">len</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">set_l</span><span class="p">)</span>
</code></pre></div></div>]]></content><author><name>Lisa</name></author><category term="codingtest" /><category term="Python" /><category term="Programmers" /><category term="codingtest" /><summary type="html"><![CDATA[]]></summary></entry><entry><title type="html">프로그래머스 Lv.1| Python - 자릿수 더하기</title><link href="http://localhost:4000/codingtest/2023/02/05/python_ct_plus/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="프로그래머스 Lv.1| Python - 자릿수 더하기" /><published>2023-02-05T12:53:41+09:00</published><updated>2023-02-05T12:53:41+09:00</updated><id>http://localhost:4000/codingtest/2023/02/05/python_ct_plus</id><content type="html" xml:base="http://localhost:4000/codingtest/2023/02/05/python_ct_plus/"><![CDATA[<p><img src="/assets/images/post/2021/2021-12-26-pg1.png" alt="pg" /></p>

<h2 id="풀이">풀이(</h2>
<div class="language-python highlighter-rouge"><div class="highlight"><pre class="highlight"><code><span class="k">def</span> <span class="nf">solution</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">n</span><span class="p">):</span>

    <span class="n">answer</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="nf">list</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="nf">map</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="nb">int</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="nf">str</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">n</span><span class="p">)))</span>

    <span class="k">return</span> <span class="nf">sum</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">answer</span><span class="p">)</span>
</code></pre></div></div>]]></content><author><name>Lisa</name></author><category term="codingtest" /><category term="Python" /><category term="Programmers" /><category term="codingtest" /><summary type="html"><![CDATA[]]></summary></entry><entry><title type="html">프로그래머스 Lv.1| Python - 핸드폰 번호 가리기</title><link href="http://localhost:4000/codingtest/2023/02/05/python_ct_masking/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="프로그래머스 Lv.1| Python - 핸드폰 번호 가리기" /><published>2023-02-05T12:53:41+09:00</published><updated>2023-02-05T12:53:41+09:00</updated><id>http://localhost:4000/codingtest/2023/02/05/python_ct_masking</id><content type="html" xml:base="http://localhost:4000/codingtest/2023/02/05/python_ct_masking/"><![CDATA[<p><img src="/assets/images/post/2021/2021-12-25-pg1.png" alt="pg" /></p>

<h2 id="풀이실패">풀이(실패)</h2>
<div class="language-python highlighter-rouge"><div class="highlight"><pre class="highlight"><code><span class="k">def</span> <span class="nf">solution</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">phone_number</span><span class="p">):</span>
    
    <span class="k">for</span> <span class="n">i</span> <span class="ow">in</span> <span class="nf">range</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="nf">len</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">phone_number</span><span class="p">)</span><span class="o">-</span><span class="mi">4</span><span class="p">):</span>
        <span class="n">phone_number</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="n">phone_number</span><span class="p">.</span><span class="nf">replace</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">phone_number</span><span class="p">[</span><span class="n">i</span><span class="p">],</span> <span class="sh">'</span><span class="s">*</span><span class="sh">'</span><span class="p">)</span>
    
    <span class="k">return</span> <span class="n">phone_number</span>
</code></pre></div></div>

<ol>
  <li>실행결과 9번만 맞고 다른 결과는 실패로 나왔습니다. 찾아보니 9번 케이스는 문자열 길이가 4인 경우라고 하네요. 실행 전 테스트 케이스는 다 통과했었는데 실패하는 이유가 뭘까요?</li>
</ol>

<h2 id="풀이성공">풀이(성공)</h2>
<div class="language-python highlighter-rouge"><div class="highlight"><pre class="highlight"><code><span class="k">def</span> <span class="nf">solution</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">phone_number</span><span class="p">):</span>
    <span class="k">return</span> <span class="sh">'</span><span class="s">*</span><span class="sh">'</span> <span class="o">*</span> <span class="p">(</span><span class="nf">len</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">phone_number</span><span class="p">)</span><span class="o">-</span><span class="mi">4</span><span class="p">)</span> <span class="o">+</span> <span class="n">phone_number</span><span class="p">[</span><span class="o">-</span><span class="mi">4</span><span class="p">:]</span>
</code></pre></div></div>

<ol>
  <li>다른 방식으로 풀이하여 통과하였습니다.</li>
</ol>]]></content><author><name>Lisa</name></author><category term="codingtest" /><category term="Python" /><category term="Programmers" /><category term="codingtest" /><summary type="html"><![CDATA[]]></summary></entry><entry><title type="html">프로그래머스 Lv.1| Python - 2016년</title><link href="http://localhost:4000/codingtest/2023/02/05/python_ct_2016/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="프로그래머스 Lv.1| Python - 2016년" /><published>2023-02-05T12:53:41+09:00</published><updated>2023-02-05T12:53:41+09:00</updated><id>http://localhost:4000/codingtest/2023/02/05/python_ct_2016</id><content type="html" xml:base="http://localhost:4000/codingtest/2023/02/05/python_ct_2016/"><![CDATA[<p><img src="/assets/images/post/2021/2021-12-24-pg1.png" alt="pg" /></p>

<h2 id="풀이">풀이</h2>
<div class="language-python highlighter-rouge"><div class="highlight"><pre class="highlight"><code><span class="kn">import</span> <span class="n">datetime</span>
<span class="k">def</span> <span class="nf">solution</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">a</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="n">b</span><span class="p">):</span>
    <span class="n">answer</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="p">[</span><span class="sh">'</span><span class="s">MON</span><span class="sh">'</span><span class="p">,</span><span class="sh">'</span><span class="s">TUE</span><span class="sh">'</span><span class="p">,</span><span class="sh">'</span><span class="s">WED</span><span class="sh">'</span><span class="p">,</span><span class="sh">'</span><span class="s">THU</span><span class="sh">'</span><span class="p">,</span><span class="sh">'</span><span class="s">FRI</span><span class="sh">'</span><span class="p">,</span><span class="sh">'</span><span class="s">SAT</span><span class="sh">'</span><span class="p">,</span><span class="sh">'</span><span class="s">SUN</span><span class="sh">'</span><span class="p">]</span>    
    
    <span class="k">return</span> <span class="n">answer</span><span class="p">[</span><span class="n">datetime</span><span class="p">.</span><span class="nf">date</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="mi">2016</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="n">a</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="n">b</span><span class="p">).</span><span class="nf">weekday</span><span class="p">()]</span>
</code></pre></div></div>

<ol>
  <li>날짜 관련 모듈을 찾아보고 간단하게 작성했습니다!</li>
</ol>]]></content><author><name>Lisa</name></author><category term="codingtest" /><category term="Python" /><category term="Programmers" /><category term="codingtest" /><summary type="html"><![CDATA[]]></summary></entry><entry><title type="html">프로그래머스 Lv.2| Python - 전화번호 목록</title><link href="http://localhost:4000/codingtest/2023/02/05/python_ct_phone/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="프로그래머스 Lv.2| Python - 전화번호 목록" /><published>2023-02-05T12:53:41+09:00</published><updated>2023-02-05T12:53:41+09:00</updated><id>http://localhost:4000/codingtest/2023/02/05/python_ct_phone</id><content type="html" xml:base="http://localhost:4000/codingtest/2023/02/05/python_ct_phone/"><![CDATA[<p><img src="/assets/images/post/2021/2021-12-18-pg1.png" alt="pg" /></p>

<h2 id="풀이">풀이</h2>
<div class="language-python highlighter-rouge"><div class="highlight"><pre class="highlight"><code><span class="k">def</span> <span class="nf">solution</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">p_b</span><span class="p">):</span>
    <span class="n">ans</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="bp">True</span>
    <span class="n">p_b</span><span class="p">.</span><span class="nf">sort</span><span class="p">()</span>

    <span class="k">for</span> <span class="n">i</span> <span class="ow">in</span> <span class="nf">range</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="nf">len</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">p_b</span><span class="p">)</span><span class="o">-</span><span class="mi">1</span><span class="p">):</span>
        <span class="k">if</span> <span class="n">p_b</span><span class="p">[</span><span class="n">i</span><span class="p">]</span> <span class="ow">in</span> <span class="n">p_b</span><span class="p">[</span><span class="n">i</span><span class="o">+</span><span class="mi">1</span><span class="p">]:</span>
            <span class="n">ans</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="bp">False</span>
            
            <span class="c1"># 접두어는 아니지만 문자가 포함될 때 오류임
</span>            <span class="c1"># ex) "223" : "5223"(X) / "2235"(O)
</span>            <span class="k">if</span> <span class="n">p_b</span><span class="p">[</span><span class="n">i</span><span class="p">].</span><span class="nf">find</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">p_b</span><span class="p">[</span><span class="n">i</span><span class="p">])</span> <span class="o">!=</span> <span class="n">p_b</span><span class="p">[</span><span class="n">i</span><span class="o">+</span><span class="mi">1</span><span class="p">].</span><span class="nf">find</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">p_b</span><span class="p">[</span><span class="n">i</span><span class="p">]):</span>
                <span class="n">ans</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="bp">True</span>
    <span class="k">return</span> <span class="n">ans</span>
</code></pre></div></div>

<ol>
  <li>제출을 했을 때 테스트 13에서 계속 오류가 났었는데 알고 보니 접두어는 아니지만 문자가 포함될 때 발생하는 오류였습니다. 그래서 해당 처리를 해주는 코드를 넣어 통과하였습니다.</li>
</ol>]]></content><author><name>Lisa</name></author><category term="codingtest" /><category term="Python" /><category term="Programmers" /><category term="codingtest" /><summary type="html"><![CDATA[]]></summary></entry><entry><title type="html">프로그래머스 Lv.1| Python - 완주하지 못한 선수</title><link href="http://localhost:4000/codingtest/2023/02/05/python_ct_participant/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="프로그래머스 Lv.1| Python - 완주하지 못한 선수" /><published>2023-02-05T12:53:41+09:00</published><updated>2023-02-05T12:53:41+09:00</updated><id>http://localhost:4000/codingtest/2023/02/05/python_ct_participant</id><content type="html" xml:base="http://localhost:4000/codingtest/2023/02/05/python_ct_participant/"><![CDATA[<p><img src="/assets/images/post/2021/2021-12-19-pg1.png" alt="pg" /></p>

<h2 id="풀이">풀이</h2>
<div class="language-python highlighter-rouge"><div class="highlight"><pre class="highlight"><code><span class="k">def</span> <span class="nf">solution</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">participant</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="n">completion</span><span class="p">):</span>
    <span class="n">answer</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="sh">''</span>
    
    <span class="n">participant</span><span class="p">.</span><span class="nf">sort</span><span class="p">()</span>
    <span class="n">completion</span><span class="p">.</span><span class="nf">sort</span><span class="p">()</span>
    
    <span class="k">for</span> <span class="n">i</span> <span class="ow">in</span> <span class="nf">range</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="nf">len</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">completion</span><span class="p">)):</span>
        <span class="nf">if </span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">participant</span><span class="p">[</span><span class="n">i</span><span class="p">]</span> <span class="o">!=</span> <span class="n">completion</span><span class="p">[</span><span class="n">i</span><span class="p">]):</span>
            <span class="k">return</span> <span class="n">participant</span><span class="p">[</span><span class="n">i</span><span class="p">]</span>

    <span class="k">return</span> <span class="n">participant</span><span class="p">[</span><span class="nf">len</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">participant</span><span class="p">)</span><span class="o">-</span><span class="mi">1</span><span class="p">]</span> 
</code></pre></div></div>]]></content><author><name>Lisa</name></author><category term="codingtest" /><category term="Python" /><category term="Programmers" /><category term="codingtest" /><summary type="html"><![CDATA[]]></summary></entry><entry><title type="html">프로그래머스 Lv.2| Python - 다음 큰 숫자</title><link href="http://localhost:4000/codingtest/2023/02/05/python_ct_nextbig/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="프로그래머스 Lv.2| Python - 다음 큰 숫자" /><published>2023-02-05T12:53:41+09:00</published><updated>2023-02-05T12:53:41+09:00</updated><id>http://localhost:4000/codingtest/2023/02/05/python_ct_nextbig</id><content type="html" xml:base="http://localhost:4000/codingtest/2023/02/05/python_ct_nextbig/"><![CDATA[<p><img src="/assets/images/post/2021/2021-12-13-pg5.png" alt="pg" /></p>

<h2 id="풀이">풀이</h2>
<div class="language-python highlighter-rouge"><div class="highlight"><pre class="highlight"><code><span class="k">def</span> <span class="nf">solution</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">n</span><span class="p">):</span>

    <span class="n">count</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="nf">bin</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">n</span><span class="p">).</span><span class="nf">count</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="sh">'</span><span class="s">1</span><span class="sh">'</span><span class="p">)</span>
    
    <span class="k">for</span> <span class="n">i</span> <span class="ow">in</span> <span class="nf">range</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">n</span><span class="o">+</span><span class="mi">1</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="mi">1000001</span><span class="p">):</span>
        <span class="k">if</span> <span class="n">count</span> <span class="o">==</span> <span class="nf">bin</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">i</span><span class="p">).</span><span class="nf">count</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="sh">'</span><span class="s">1</span><span class="sh">'</span><span class="p">):</span>
            <span class="k">return</span> <span class="n">i</span>
</code></pre></div></div>]]></content><author><name>Lisa</name></author><category term="codingtest" /><category term="Python" /><category term="Programmers" /><category term="codingtest" /><summary type="html"><![CDATA[]]></summary></entry><entry><title type="html">프로그래머스 Lv.2| Python - 더 맵게</title><link href="http://localhost:4000/codingtest/2023/02/05/python_ct_morehot/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="프로그래머스 Lv.2| Python - 더 맵게" /><published>2023-02-05T12:53:41+09:00</published><updated>2023-02-05T12:53:41+09:00</updated><id>http://localhost:4000/codingtest/2023/02/05/python_ct_morehot</id><content type="html" xml:base="http://localhost:4000/codingtest/2023/02/05/python_ct_morehot/"><![CDATA[<p><img src="/assets/images/post/2021/2021-12-15-pg1.png" alt="pg" /></p>

<h2 id="풀이">풀이</h2>
<div class="language-python highlighter-rouge"><div class="highlight"><pre class="highlight"><code><span class="kn">import</span> <span class="n">heapq</span>
<span class="k">def</span> <span class="nf">solution</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">sco</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="n">K</span><span class="p">):</span>
    <span class="c1"># heapq.heapify(sco)
</span>    <span class="n">sco</span><span class="p">.</span><span class="nf">sort</span><span class="p">()</span>  <span class="c1"># 시간이 더 적게 걸림
</span>    <span class="n">count</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="mi">0</span>
    
    <span class="k">while</span> <span class="n">sco</span><span class="p">[</span><span class="mi">0</span><span class="p">]</span> <span class="o">&lt;</span> <span class="n">K</span><span class="p">:</span>           
        <span class="k">if</span> <span class="nf">len</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">sco</span><span class="p">)</span> <span class="o">&lt;=</span> <span class="mi">1</span><span class="p">:</span>
            <span class="k">return</span> <span class="o">-</span><span class="mi">1</span>
        <span class="k">else</span><span class="p">:</span>
            <span class="n">heapq</span><span class="p">.</span><span class="nf">heappush</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">sco</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="n">heapq</span><span class="p">.</span><span class="nf">heappop</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">sco</span><span class="p">)</span> <span class="o">+</span> <span class="n">heapq</span><span class="p">.</span><span class="nf">heappop</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">sco</span><span class="p">)</span> <span class="o">*</span> <span class="mi">2</span><span class="p">)</span>  
            <span class="n">count</span> <span class="o">+=</span> <span class="mi">1</span>  
    <span class="k">return</span> <span class="n">count</span>
</code></pre></div></div>

<ol>
  <li>heapq 함수를 사용했습니다. 리스트 정렬을 먼저 하고 코드를 작성했는데 정렬을 할 때 heapq.heapify()보다는 .sort()가 시간이 더 적게 걸렸습니다.</li>
</ol>]]></content><author><name>Lisa</name></author><category term="codingtest" /><category term="Python" /><category term="Programmers" /><category term="codingtest" /><summary type="html"><![CDATA[]]></summary></entry></feed>